<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= t('privacy_policy') %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../static/styles/main.css">
</head>
<body>
   <%- include("partials/nav.ejs") %>

<div class="container privacy-content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy | 隐私政策</h1>
    <p class="privacy-date">Last Updated: April 2026</p>

    <!-- Section 1: Introduction -->
    <section>
        <h2>1. Introduction / 简介</h2>
        <p>Welcome to Taskify. We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. This policy explains what information we collect and how we use it.</p>
        <p>欢迎使用 Taskify。我们致力于保护您的个人信息和隐私权。本政策解释了我们收集哪些信息以及如何使用这些信息。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Data Collection -->
    <section>
        <h2>2. Information We Collect / 我们收集的信息</h2>
        <p>In this project, we collect the following data:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Name and email address provided during signup.</li>
            <li><strong>Task Data:</strong> Content of tasks you create and manage.</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> Technical cookies used to manage your login session and language preferences.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>在本项目中，我们收集以下数据：</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>账户数据：</strong> 注册时提供的姓名和电子邮件地址。</li>
            <li><strong>任务数据：</strong> 您创建和管理任务的内容。</li>
            <li><strong>Cookie：</strong> 用于管理登录会话和语言偏好的技术性 Cookie。</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Use of Data -->
    <section>
        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information / 我们如何使用信息</h2>
        <p>Your data is used solely to provide task management services, including user authentication and personalized task lists. We do not sell your data to third parties.</p>
        <p>您的数据仅用于提供任务管理服务，包括用户身份验证和个性化任务列表。我们不会向第三方出售您的数据。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 4: Security -->
    <section>
        <h2>4. Data Security / 数据安全</h2>
        <p>We implement technical measures to protect your data, including encrypted database storage (MongoDB Atlas) and secure session management.</p>
        <p>我们实施技术措施保护您的数据，包括加密的数据库存储（MongoDB Atlas）和安全的会话管理。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 5: Academic Disclaimer (非常重要，对大作业加分) -->
    <section class="privacy-disclaimer">
        <h2>5. Academic Disclaimer / 学术免责声明</h2>
        <p>This application is developed for <strong>CPT304 Software Engineering 2</strong> coursework purposes at XJTLU. It is not a commercial product. Please do not upload sensitive real-world personal data.</p>
        <p>本应用程序是为西交利物浦大学 <strong>CPT304 软件工程 2</strong> 课程作业开发的。它不是商业产品。请勿上传敏感的真实个人数据。</p>
    </section>

    <a href="/" class="btn-back">Back to Home / 返回首页</a>
</div>

<%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>
</body>
</html>